- It's a book that's made a
big difference in my life.

01:04:57.410 --> 01:04:59.159
- A book.
- Joel Osteen's--

01:04:59.159 --> 01:05:00.330
(Link chuckles)

01:05:00.330 --> 01:05:02.868
Live Your Best Life Now.

01:05:02.868 --> 01:05:04.500
- What a coincidence.

01:05:04.500 --> 01:05:06.490
- Yeah I planned on recommending this.

01:05:06.490 --> 01:05:09.850
No, I can't say that I
would recommend that book.

01:05:09.850 --> 01:05:12.823
