out of it but what I,

01:05:18.810 --> 01:05:21.230
I actually was planning on
recommending something else

01:05:21.230 --> 01:05:23.760
but I am gonna recommend
something I recommended before

01:05:23.760 --> 01:05:25.520
but I'm gonna say it again.

01:05:25.520 --> 01:05:26.453
Therapy.

01:05:27.840 --> 01:05:29.160
- Did you just change your answer?

01:05:29.160 --> 01:05:30.190
- Yeah.
- Oh.

01:05:30.190 --> 01:05:31.970
- I actually had something
else but I can save it

01:05:31.970 --> 01:05:33.870
