01:05:52.680 --> 01:05:55.500
if you wanna use the analogy of a car,

01:05:55.500 --> 01:06:00.290
I think that the idea of I
don't take my car in, man,

01:06:00.290 --> 01:06:02.360
until I got a problem. (chuckles)

01:06:02.360 --> 01:06:03.730
You know what I'm saying, man?

01:06:03.730 --> 01:06:07.850
But I think if you want your
car to continue to run clean,

01:06:07.850 --> 01:06:09.010
you want it to be trouble free,

01:06:09.010 --> 01:06:11.850
you take it in for the
scheduled maintenance, man.

01:06:11.850 --> 01:06:13.570
And the scheduled maintenance--

01:06:13.570 --> 01:06:15.530
- You can watch my daughter on The View

01:06:15.530 --> 01:06:16.770
or whatever she's on.

01:06:16.770 --> 01:06:21.460
- In the scheduled
maintenance of your body,

01:06:21.460 --> 01:06:24.540
there's an interesting dichotomy
that somehow in our culture

01:06:24.540 --> 01:06:27.600
we have this huge mind-body split

01:06:27.600 --> 01:06:29.650
and like yeah, I got a
problem with my knee.

01:06:29.650 --> 01:06:31.760
That's something I can
talk to my boys about.

01:06:31.760 --> 01:06:35.410
I know that I'm characterizing
everyone who's ignorant

01:06:35.410 --> 01:06:37.330
as with a southern accent
and I'm just doing it

01:06:37.330 --> 01:06:38.589
because that's where I'm from--

01:06:38.589 --> 01:06:40.170
