01:06:48.430 --> 01:06:51.270
But the idea that you can talk freely

01:06:51.270 --> 01:06:54.740
about your physical
problems but when you get

01:06:54.740 --> 01:06:56.930
to talking about mental
problems that suddenly,

01:06:56.930 --> 01:06:58.680
this isn't something you
can share with a friend.

01:06:58.680 --> 01:07:01.670
This is something that
you're gonna be judged for,

01:07:01.670 --> 01:07:04.570
that's an unfortunate
side effect of something

01:07:04.570 --> 01:07:06.650
that's gone wrong with
this particular society.

01:07:06.650 --> 01:07:08.430
- When you say mental
you mean emotionally.

01:07:08.430 --> 01:07:10.381
- Mental and emotional.
- All types of--

01:07:10.381 --> 01:07:14.880
- And I think that I wish
I had discovered it earlier

01:07:14.880 --> 01:07:17.820
and I highly recommend it and

01:07:19.680 --> 01:07:22.120
I know that for a lot of
people, cost is an issue

01:07:22.120 --> 01:07:23.680
and I don't know what
the solution is for that.

01:07:23.680 --> 01:07:25.680
I know at one point we
recommended Better Help

01:07:25.680 --> 01:07:27.220
