01:07:31.410 --> 01:07:33.250
but they're not a sponsor anymore.

01:07:33.250 --> 01:07:36.390
But I don't know what the alternatives are

01:07:36.390 --> 01:07:37.800
for sort of low-cost

01:07:40.275 --> 01:07:45.270
mental health help, but
I'll just say that--

01:07:45.270 --> 01:07:47.070
- I think they have clarified their,

01:07:49.376 --> 01:07:50.850
the qualifications of the people

01:07:50.850 --> 01:07:52.070
and that cleared some things up

01:07:52.070 --> 01:07:56.260
and they also refined what types of issues

01:07:56.260 --> 01:07:57.230
that they're tackling.

01:07:57.230 --> 01:07:59.747
- Okay so do your own research in that--

01:07:59.747 --> 01:08:03.530
