is a legitimate recourse.

01:08:03.530 --> 01:08:06.770
I would encourage people to
check that out on their own.

01:08:06.770 --> 01:08:10.290
- Yeah so I'm just saying
that do your own research

01:08:10.290 --> 01:08:12.470
