that you're spending money

01:08:21.800 --> 01:08:24.900
on that may not be as important and so,

01:08:24.900 --> 01:08:27.867
do what you can to find that help.

01:08:27.867 --> 01:08:29.200
- All right.
- It's important.

01:08:29.200 --> 01:08:30.640
